   "cite": "Constructed teaching object (this film): a 1,000-customer market with exactly 500 yes, laid out by a mulberry32 shuffle (seed 36); 20 surveys of 30 (seed 10227) and 20 of 1,000 (seed 14), each response an independent draw with replacement from the 1,000 marks. The hook survey (18 of 30) is survey 1 of this draw."
  }
